    "head_branch": "feature/spec-39-step-10c-ii-seek-walk-facing-pool",
    "head_commit_message": "feat(sim): seek, walk and facing on the pool from the threshold (spec 39 step 10c-ii)\n\nThe walk takes each unit's step apart, the facing turns each squad apart,\nand the seek's per-squad search (seekers, keys, rings) runs apart, all on\nRayon's pool when `Threads::on` says so, written back in member and squad\norder. The seek's claims stay serial in contest order. Outcomes identical;\nCI's both-ways digests and trials check it.\n\nRefs #557\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi4kMBEQYaWYpniaBPZ",
